{"items":[{"str":"don’t have access to breast screening, or even know it exists. But institu-","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,156,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tionalized violence—the destruction of millions of lives through poverty","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,156,636],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"and","dir":"ltr","width":15,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,156,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,171,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"neglect,","dir":"ltr","width":32,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,176,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,208,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"the","dir":"ltr","width":13,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,213,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,226,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"abuse","dir":"ltr","width":22,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,232,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,254,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"practiced","dir":"ltr","width":36,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,260,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,296,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"against","dir":"ltr","width":28,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,302,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,329,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"women","dir":"ltr","width":29,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,335,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,364,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"and","dir":"ltr","width":15,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,370,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,385,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"children,","dir":"ltr","width":36,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,390,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,426,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"the","dir":"ltr","width":13,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,431,623],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"slaughter of 100,000 Iraqis—has no easy representation. The stage of","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,156,610],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the serial killer acts as a substitute and a shield for a situation so incom-","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,156,597],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"prehensible and threatening it must be disavowed.","dir":"ltr","width":202,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,156,584],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,358,584],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"20","dir":"ltr","width":7,"height":6,"transform":[6,0,0,6,358,587],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"The popular fascination with random, illogical, and individual psycho-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"logically motivated violence is a reassuring fiction for people because it","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"does not focus our attention on institutionalized social violence—vio-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"lence that is motivated by reasons we see all too clearly (poverty, dis-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,509],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"crimination, etc.). At the same time, we acknowledge, on some sub-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,495],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"conscious level, that violence saturates our social order; but we dis-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,481],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"place it from its economic and political roots onto the figure of the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"psycho serial killer. This is one of the meanings of “seriality”: the re-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"peated nature of the violence points beyond the isolated incidents of","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,439],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"violence toward the notion that violence, in our culture, is pervasive","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,425],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"and repeated.","dir":"ltr","width":60,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"In order to further develop this issue of the “privatization” or “in-","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"dividualization” of violence that Taubin claims motivates the fascina-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tion with serial killers, we may find it useful to sketch the historical de-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,369],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"velopment of the ideology of liberal individualism. To call individual-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,355],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ism an ideology is to argue that one must account—historically, as well","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"as in other ways—for a phenomenon that, when we see it enacted in","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"representation, presents itself to us as self-evident reality.","dir":"ltr","width":252,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"The liberal","dir":"ltr","width":49,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,205,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"bourgeois","dir":"ltr","width":47,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,210,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,257,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":"political tradition, which was developed in","dir":"ltr","width":195,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,261,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Europe in the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries and corresponds","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"on an intimate level to the economic system known as","dir":"ltr","width":257,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,401,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"capitalism","dir":"ltr","width":48,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,405,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":",","dir":"ltr","width":3,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,453,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"constructs individuals as the primary entity in society. This represents","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"a kind of cellular view of the body politic, where the whole is made up","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,243],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"of autonomous, almost self-sufficient and independent entities who,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,229],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"acting together, form the whole body and motivate its actions. In fact,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,215],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"some feminist historians of evolutionary biology, such as Evelyn Fox","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Keller, have launched a critique against just this picture of the func-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tioning of the human body, pointing out that it is not possible to take","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"a cellular view of living organisms because most of them, particularly","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,159],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"humans, never function in a way that isolates one cell. Cells are part of","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 27 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f1":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.72,"descent":-0.245,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false}},"lang":null}